<section class="orbitra-story orbitra-story--cta" id="how-it-works">

  <div class="orbitra-container">

 

    <div class="orbitra-action-card orbitra-glass" data-reveal>

      <div class="orbitra-action-card__copy">

        <p class="orbitra-eyebrow">SEE IT IN ACTION</p>

 

        <h2 class="orbitra-section-title">

          Watch Orbitra

          <span>take flight.</span>

        </h2>

 

        <p class="orbitra-subtitle orbitra-action-card__text">

          See the throw, the curve, and the catch without loading the full video

          on the homepage.

        </p>

 

        <a

          href="/pages/see-it-in-action"

          class="orbitra-button orbitra-action-card__button"

        >

          Watch Orbitra in action

          <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>

        </a>

      </div>

 

      <div class="orbitra-action-card__visual" aria-hidden="true">

        <div class="orbitra-action-card__glow"></div>

 

        <img

          src="{{ 'orbita-1.png' | asset_url }}"

          alt=""

          class="orbitra-action-card__image"

          loading="lazy"

          width="1200"

          height="1200"

        >

 

        <div class="orbitra-action-card__play">

          <span>▶</span>

        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

 

    <div class="orbitra-steps">

      <article class="orbitra-step" data-reveal>

        <span class="orbitra-step__number">01</span>

        <h3>Power it on.</h3>

        <p>Switch on Orbitra, hold the center axis, and spin the wheel to start the rotor.</p>

      </article>

 

      <article class="orbitra-step" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1">

        <span class="orbitra-step__number">02</span>

        <h3>Give it a toss.</h3>

        <p>Use a controlled throw and change the angle to explore different flight paths.</p>

      </article>

 

      <article class="orbitra-step" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="2">

        <span class="orbitra-step__number">03</span>

        <h3>Guide the flight.</h3>

        <p>Experiment with direction, distance, and timing while the LEDs light up the motion.</p>

      </article>

 

      <article class="orbitra-step" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="3">

        <span class="orbitra-step__number">04</span>

        <h3>Catch. Repeat.</h3>

        <p>Catch Orbitra, reset your throw, and try a new route, trick, or return path.</p>

      </article>

    </div>

 

    <div class="orbitra-spec-strip orbitra-glass" data-reveal>

      <div><strong>6–8 MIN</strong><span>Typical flight time</span></div>

      <div><strong>30–35 MIN</strong><span>Charging time</span></div>

      <div><strong>9.5 × 9.5 CM</strong><span>Compact size</span></div>

      <div><strong>USB</strong><span>Rechargeable</span></div>

    </div>

 

  </div>

</section>

 

{% schema %}

{

  "name": "Orbitra Story",

  "settings": [],

  "presets": [

    {

      "name": "Orbitra Story"

    }

  ]

}

{% endschema %}

